## Emergency Shortcuts

If running out of time:
- Skip t-SNE visualization (Step 12)
- Skip adversarial examples (Bonus)
- Use smaller dataset (100 samples per class)
- Train for fewer epochs (15 instead of 30)
- Simplify network (256→128→10 instead of 512→256→10)

The priority is: **Working code > Accuracy > Advanced features**